 patch 0004 (WebXR compositor layers), the sky painted before the session, docs\n- Nothing is broken\n- I couldn't find out which driver caused today's blue screen\n- A Studio or pipeline change\n- Verdict: the website's analytics still works\n- Bottom line: Store buyers are still locked out, now for a 5th day\n- Added the nightly Balloon Tag scenario\n- Implemented decision screening: prior answers and non-choices return to the agent; new questions and failures reach you\n- Implemented nightly runs at 02:00 local: isolated checkout, dedicated ports, overlap protection, and finding cards merged through Studio\u2019s checks, with a 06:45 cutoff\n- Implemented approve, reject and retry requests with saved checkpoints and correct error responses\n- Two choices for you today, both on your cards\n- I reworked Studio's Analytics tab (card studio-analytics-tab-rework)\n- I wrote the roster review It recommends retiring Dash and keeping the other five, and you can answer it with yes or no\n- I built the question judge\n- I added the nightly playtest bots", "created_date": 1794938783, "id": "40387974530816522", "version": "2.1.3", "version_code": 506, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 1}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "27706668015613967", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "40441626738784634"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1794894642, "id": "40372146725732636", "version": "2.1.2", "version_code": 505, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 1}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBi